{"4200130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trigger of Silence", "steam_appid": 4200130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Trigger of Silence》 is a first-person survival defense game that combines intense melee combat with gunplay. In this invaded world, you play as a super soldier who must hold your ground and fend off waves of dragon-like humanoid creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Weapons </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features very unique weapons. Each weapon can use skill cartridges to unleash powerful abilities, dealing devastating damage to groups of monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tower Defense System </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some weapons can use skill cartridges to summon automated turrets, adding tower defense elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wave Attacks! Advance! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large numbers of enemies will attack at set intervals, and players must eliminate hordes of monsters to survive. During the advance, certain levels require players to drive vehicles to sweep through large groups of monsters and enter monster nests to defeat the bosses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Background </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2040, a laboratory secretly conducted portal experiments. After opening a portal, a humanoid glowing figure emerged, immediately taking control of the portal and bringing a large number of monsters. After the lab sent out a distress signal, you, as a super soldier, are sent by your superiors to investigate the laboratory, eliminate all monsters encountered along the way, and eventually uncover who brought the monsters and what their purpose is.</p>", "about_the_game": "<